  "description": "Non-material amendments to planning permission reference: 2021/01073/FUL dated 4th August 2021 for the \"Erection of a single storey extension to side entrance elevation; the rendering of the existing brickwork walls of the community hall; installation of rooflights in the front and rear roofslope; infilling of 2no windows to side entrance elevation; replacement of existing doors and windows with new doors and windows to the front, rear and side elevations; associated landscaping.\"  Amendments sought are the omitting of the approved roof lights and reduction to the size of the approved canopy to the front elevation; adjustments to the large external doors to form two standard double doors and the addition of an additional external window to the rear elevation overlooking the private courtyard; replacement of one approved door with a window to the elevation facing the playing area; and the addition of a window to the existing store room to the side entrance elevation overlooking the private courtyard.",
